Package: rHCL
Title: Implementation of the Homeostatic-Circadian-Light Model 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Reis", , "daniel.reis2@va.gov", 
	   role = c("aut", "cre"), 
 	   comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7806-3819"))
Description: Implements the Homeostatic-Circadian-Light (HCL) model in R, as 
    described by Skeldon et al. (2023) 
    <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1011743>. Estimates sleep pressure
    (i.e., mu) and circadian period (i.e., tau) parameters from light exposure
    and sleep data. Also estimates the daily circadian effect of light with
    respect to the speeding up or slowing down of the circadian pacemaker.
